4
00:00:08.616 --> 00:00:12.520
Two boxes on the drawing do not make two
independent measurements.

5
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:16.160
If the sensor fails low, both functions
may receive the

6
00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.944
