7
00:00:18.064 --> 00:00:22.231
Whether that matters depends on the
process risk and other protections.

8
00:00:22.351 --> 00:00:27.364
State the failure mechanism before
deciding whether an independent sensor or

9
00:00:27.484 --> 00:00:30.002
