behaviour and operator information

12
00:00:39.864 --> 00:00:41.912
appropriate to the intended use.

13
00:00:42.032 --> 00:00:46.662
Our teaching example proposes inhibiting
heating and generating an

14
00:00:46.782 --> 00:00:51.326
