response and operator indication.

31
00:01:53.134 --> 00:01:58.297
Also consider restoration: an uncontrolled
restart may be unacceptable.

32
00:01:58.417 --> 00:02:02.001
During DQ, check that the design and test
method make

33
00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:03.614
